  "follow_up": [],
  "clinical_uncertainties": [],
  "clinical_evidence": [
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "speaker_role": "patient",
      "transcript_text": "I haven't asked three times. Twice. Well, perhaps three. Anyway, doctor, it's these dizzy spells that bother me, that's why we've come.",
      "start_timestamp": "00:33",
      "end_timestamp": "00:43",
      "supports": [
        "chief_complaint",
        "symptoms[0]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_002",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "speaker_role": "patient",
      "transcript_text": "Mostly when I get up out of the chair. The room goes all swimmy and I have to hold on to the table until it passes.",
      "start_timestamp": "00:54",
      "end_timestamp": "01:07",
      "supports": [
        "symptoms[0]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "speaker_role": "patient",
      "transcript_text": "Oh, a fortnight. No, longer than that. Two weeks, three weeks, I think, it was before my last appointment at the hairdresser's anyway.",
      "start_timestamp": "01:14",
      "end_timestamp": "01:25",
      "supports": [
        "symptoms[0]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_004",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "speaker_role": "caregiver",
      "transcript_text": "It's three weeks, doctor. I wrote it on the calendar the day she nearly went over in the kitchen.",
      "start_timestamp": "01:26",
      "end_timestamp": "01:38",
      "supports": [
        "symptoms[0]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "speaker_role": "patient",
      "transcript_text": "Most mornings, and once after lunch. It's never in the evenings, is it, Marisol? Or was that Tuesday?",
      "start_timestamp": "01:50",
      "end_timestamp": "02:01",
      "supports": [
        "symptoms[0]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_006",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "speaker_role": "patient",
      "transcript_text": "Every other Friday, and she's seventy-eight and still going. I was a teacher for forty years, you know, and half her customers are my old pupils' mothers.",
      "start_timestamp": "02:17",
      "end_timestamp": "02:30",
      "supports": [
        "medical_history.social_history[0]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_007",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "speaker_role": "doctor",
      "transcript_text": "What a wonderful thing. Now, the ankles. When I saw you they were quite puffy, how are they?",
      "start_timestamp": "02:31",
      "end_timestamp": "02:40",
      "supports": [
        "symptoms[1]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_008",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "speaker_role": "patient",
      "transcript_text": "The swelling in my ankles has gone, hasn't it, Marisol? I can get my slippers on again without a shoehorn.",
      "start_timestamp": "02:42",
      "end_timestamp": "02:54",
      "supports": [
        "symptoms[1]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_009",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "speaker_role": "doctor",
      "transcript_text": "Tell me about the tablets then. What is she taking at the moment?",
      "start_timestamp": "03:08",
      "end_timestamp": "03:14",
      "supports": [
        "medications[0]",
        "medications[1]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_010",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "speaker_role": "caregiver",
      "transcript_text": "The amlodipine, five milligrams every morning for her blood pressure. And paracetamol, the 500 milligram ones, when she needs them for the arthritis.",
      "start_timestamp": "03:15",
      "end_timestamp": "03:27",
      "supports": [
        "medications[0]",
        "medications[1]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "speaker_role": "patient",
      "transcript_text": "I've had the high blood pressure since I was fifty. And the arthritis is in my hands mostly, that's why I can't manage the childproof lids.",
      "start_timestamp": "03:28",
      "end_timestamp": "03:41",
      "supports": [
        "medical_history.past_medical_history[0]",
        "medical_history.past_medical_history[1]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_012",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "speaker_role": "patient",
      "transcript_text": "It's my own flat, I've been in it since 1974, and Marisol has the little back room now. I wouldn't live anywhere else.",
      "start_timestamp": "05:10",
      "end_timestamp": "05:23",
      "supports": [
        "medical_history.social_history[1]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_013",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "speaker_role": "doctor",
      "transcript_text": "And I won't ask what you get up to on a Friday night, but do you still enjoy your sherry?",
      "start_timestamp": "05:25",
      "end_timestamp": "05:35",
      "supports": [
        "medical_history.social_history[2]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_014",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "speaker_role": "patient",
      "transcript_text": "One glass on a Sunday, that's the only drink I have all week. Don't look at me like that, Marisol.",
      "start_timestamp": "05:37",
      "end_timestamp": "05:48",
      "supports": [
        "medical_history.social_history[2]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_015",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "speaker_role": "doctor",
      "transcript_text": "Your chest sounds clear, and there's no swelling in either ankle now. Nice and slim, those ankles.",
      "start_timestamp": "06:33",
      "end_timestamp": "06:42",
      "supports": [
        "physical_examination[0]",
        "physical_examination[1]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "speaker_role": "doctor",
      "transcript_text": "Any trouble with your breathing, or with your chest when you get dizzy?",
      "start_timestamp": "06:43",
      "end_timestamp": "06:51",
      "supports": [
        "review_of_systems[0]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "speaker_role": "patient",
      "transcript_text": "No, my breathing is fine. I walked up the path with the stick and I wasn't puffed at all.",
      "start_timestamp": "06:53",
      "end_timestamp": "07:02",
      "supports": [
        "review_of_systems[0]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "speaker_role": "doctor",
      "transcript_text": "Good. Here's my thinking. I can't rule out your blood pressure dropping when you stand up, and the morning tablet going in twice on some days could be adding to it. I'm not going to guess beyond that today.",
      "start_timestamp": "07:03",
      "end_timestamp": "07:23",
      "supports": [
        "clinical_assessment[0]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_019",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "speaker_role": "doctor",
      "transcript_text": "I'd like to arrange a blood test today, and an ECG, a tracing of the heart, before you leave the building. Both are quick, and the nurse down the hall will do them.",
      "start_timestamp": "07:31",
      "end_timestamp": "07:49",
      "supports": [
        "procedures_and_investigations[0]",
        "procedures_and_investigations[1]",
        "clinical_actions[0]",
        "clinical_actions[1]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "speaker_role": "doctor",
      "transcript_text": "Just a small scratch, and you can lie down for it. And Marisol, a weekly pill organiser would help, you fill it on Sunday and the old boxes go in a locked drawer.",
      "start_timestamp": "08:02",
      "end_timestamp": "08:18",
      "supports": [
        "clinical_actions[2]"
      ]
    }
  ],
